		NPCs: {
			Siren: {
				DisplayName: Siren

				TownNPCMood: {
					Content: Things are all right here... Could we sit quietly for a little while?
					NoHome: I wish I had a little place of my own... with enough room to stretch.
					FarFromHome: My home is so far away... I think I would rather go back.
					LoveSpace: I can breathe here, and practice without so many eyes on me.
					DislikeCrowded: There are too many people nearby... My voice just disappears.
					HateCrowded: S-sorry... I need somewhere quiet. I cannot sing like this.
					LoveBiome: The waves sing with me in {BiomeName}. It is easier to let my voice out...
					LikeBiome: I like {BiomeName}. There is a melody in the wind, if you listen closely.
					DislikeBiome: "{BiomeName} makes my throat dry... I should probably rest my voice."
					HateBiome: "{BiomeName} frightens me... Could we leave, please?"
					LoveNPC: "{NPCName} listens without rushing me. Being near someone like that makes me want to sing."
					LikeNPC: I like listening to {NPCName}'s stories... even the ones that sound made up.
					DislikeNPC: "{NPCName} wants me to sing in front of everyone... Just thinking about it makes me nervous."
					HateNPC: "{NPCName}'s explosions startle me. I always forget the next note..."
					LikeNPC_Princess: "{NPCName} is so kind... She does not seem to mind when I speak softly."
					Princess_LovesNPC: "{NPCName} has such a gentle voice. I hope she feels comfortable sharing it someday."
				}
			}
		}

		Dialogue: {
			Siren: {
				DisableSinging: Disable singing
				EnableSinging: Enable singing
				StandardDialogue1: H-hi... I heard you coming. I was just trying to think of something to say.
				StandardDialogue2: If I speak too softly, you can come a little closer... Just a little.
				StandardDialogue3: I saved a pretty shell for you... I mean, for the shop. But you can have a look.
				StandardDialogue4: Thank you for the high ceiling. It is nice not having to curl up all the time.
				StandardDialogue5: Underwater, nobody notices when I blush... It is harder up here.
				StandardDialogue6: I know how to use a trident. I just do not really know how to start a conversation...
				HappyDialogue1: I was humming just now... You can stay for the rest, if you like.
				HappyDialogue2: The melody came all by itself today. I think I am starting to feel at home.
				HappyDialogue3: You heard that? It was a song from my childhood... I could sing a little more, if you like.
				ShyDialogue1: I do sing... But my voice hides when I realize someone is waiting for it.
				ShyDialogue2: Maybe I will sing in a little while. Could we just listen to the wind until then?
				ShyDialogue3: It is not that I dislike your company... I just need a little time to get used to it.
				UnhappyDialogue1: I would rather be quiet today... I hope you do not mind.
				UnhappyDialogue2: I tried singing a little, but stopped after the first note. I miss feeling safe.
				UnhappyDialogue3: I still remember the songs... I just do not feel like singing them here.
			}
		}

		Bestiary.Siren: A shy siren who finds in songs the courage she lacks in conversation. Her voice is heard more often when she feels at home.

		Tiles: {
			BubbleMaker.MapEntry: Bubble Maker
			WaterElementalGate.MapEntry: Water Elemental Gate
			IronCage.MapEntry: Iron Cage
		}
	}
